                   <div class="lb-txt-16 lb-rtxt" style="color:#232f3e;">
                    <p>Calculate your&nbsp;Amazon SageMaker and architecture cost in a single estimate. <br></p>
                   </div>
                   <div class="lb-txt-blue-600 lb-rtxt">
                    <p><b>Create your custom estimate now&nbsp;»</b></p>
                   </div>
                  </div>
                 </div>
                </div></a>
