               <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p><b>Amazon SageMaker with TensorBoard</b> <br>
                   Amazon SageMaker with TensorBoard provides a hosted TensorBoard experience to to visualize and debug model convergence issues for Amazon SageMaker training jobs. <br></p>
