                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p><strong>Amazon SageMaker Data Wrangler Jobs</strong></p>
                 <p>An Amazon SageMaker Data Wrangler job is created when a data flow is exported from SageMaker Data Wrangler. With SageMaker Data Wrangler jobs, you can automate your data preparation workflows. SageMaker Data Wrangler jobs help you reapply your data preparation workflows on new datasets to help save you time, and are billed by the second.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="aws-element-333e287a-a2a7-4e37-be42-824fdcaa69b0" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-datawrangler&quot;]" data-token-keys="[]" data-token-sets="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-datawrangler.[Standard Instances - ML Instance - DataWrangler-Processing]&quot;]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-token-bjs="false" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-333e287a-a2a7-4e37-be42-824fdcaa69b0-content" data-sort-property="sagemaker/sagemaker-datawrangler.[Standard Instances - ML Instance - DataWrangler-Processing].[Instance]" data-sort-order="instance-capacity" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<p>{regionSelector}</p>
