<tr><td>General Purpose (SSD) Storage</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-storage!wkRN1ctjhFL1RqdEdzJnayRBsimG4Fw9dFkMDCYtQWc} per GB-month of provisioned storage</td></tr>
