               </div></li>
              <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
               <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                MLflow
               </div></li>
              <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-tab-11" id="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-panel-11" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
               <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p><b>Amazon SageMaker with MLflow</b> <br><span>Amazon SageMaker with MLflow allows customers to pay only for what you use. Customers pay for MLflow Tracking Servers based on compute and storage costs. <br><br>
                    Customers will pay for compute based on the size of the Tracking Server and number of hours it was running. In addition, customers will pay for any metadata stored on the MLflow Tracking Server.</span> <br></p>
                </div>
                <div id="aws-element-61d89e9b-bcd4-4702-a732-0bf198659144" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow.[8Cl8hDoz_Azv1TwFTljfDoaT1eROQ22qw5_t3Gn_ZlQ 1]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow.[dvVhf3tPzLzEj2HM10v6a54lRy2EF0TIhCkBYZu9P-M 1]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow.[9iLgnqiZghsRQ6ykwipiXTWTNmm-h3HB1sb0CJhXOQY 1]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="hidden" data-template="#aws-element-61d89e9b-bcd4-4702-a732-0bf198659144-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<p>{regionSelector}</p>
<h3>MLflow Tracking Server Compute</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Tracking Server Size</th><th>Price Per Hour</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Small</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow!9iLgnqiZghsRQ6ykwipiXTWTNmm-h3HB1sb0CJhXOQY!1}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Medium</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow!8Cl8hDoz_Azv1TwFTljfDoaT1eROQ22qw5_t3Gn_ZlQ!1}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Large</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow!dvVhf3tPzLzEj2HM10v6a54lRy2EF0TIhCkBYZu9P-M!1}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
                <div id="aws-element-622eb1b7-4f63-4e0c-8d56-cf7f0a3dfb33" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow.[m43INM0PsNiT-icJ5mVbzPO9jiTNBbAsPqGnDcWdfO0 2]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="hidden" data-template="#aws-element-622eb1b7-4f63-4e0c-8d56-cf7f0a3dfb33-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<h3>MLflow Tracking Server Storage</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th></th><th>Price Per GB-month</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Tracking Server Storage</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-mlflow!m43INM0PsNiT-icJ5mVbzPO9jiTNBbAsPqGnDcWdfO0!2}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
               </div></li>
              <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
               <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                Real-Time Inference
               </div></li>
              <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-tab-12" id="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-panel-12" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
               <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p><b>Amazon SageMaker Hosting: Real-Time Inference</b> <br>
                   Amazon SageMaker provides real-time inference for your use cases needing real-time predictions. You are charged for usage of the instance type you choose. When you use Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor to maintain highly accurate models providing real-time inference, you can use built-in rules to monitor your models or write your own custom rules. For built-in rules, you get up to 30 hours of monitoring at no charge. Additional charges will be based on duration of usage. You are charged separately when you use your own custom rules. <br></p>
                </div>
