              <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
               <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                Serverless Inference
               </div></li>
              <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-tab-15" id="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-panel-15" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
               <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p><b>Amazon SageMaker Serverless Inference</b> <br>
                   Amazon SageMaker Serverless Inference enables you to deploy machine learning models for inference without configuring or managing any of the underlying infrastructure.&nbsp;You can either use on-demand Serverless Inference or add Provisioned Concurrency to your endpoint for predictable performance.</p>
                 <p>With on-demand Serverless Inference, you only pay for the compute capacity used to process inference requests, billed by the millisecond, and the amount of data processed. The compute charge depends on the memory configuration you choose. <br><br></p>
                </div>
                <div id="aws-element-668042f1-1f2a-46af-8c4a-38429e653eb2" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference&quot;]" data-token-keys="[]" data-token-sets="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[Serverless]&quot;]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-token-bjs="false" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-668042f1-1f2a-46af-8c4a-38429e653eb2-content" data-sort-property="sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[Serverless 1].[Memory(GB)]" data-sort-order="asc" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<h2></h2>
<p>{regionSelector}</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Memory (GB)</th><th>Price per second</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>{bulkStringOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-inference!Serverless![Memory(GB)]!*!1024}</td><td>{bulkPriceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-inference!Serverless![price]!decimals=7}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
                <div id="aws-element-00053a0e-4c67-4920-ab77-29a8f79c5890" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-storage&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-storage.[vMi89LFj_RRWhGmnjV24p2fL9UaN9iBNn4lRqyQllHA]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-storage.[jbbH5x-b2emSCGj6MC9wSMk6qtgheK-QbrvHXUa08xE]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="hidden" data-template="#aws-element-00053a0e-4c67-4920-ab77-29a8f79c5890-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<h3>Data Processing</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th></th><th>Price</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Data Processed IN</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-storage!jbbH5x-b2emSCGj6MC9wSMk6qtgheK-QbrvHXUa08xE} per GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Data Processed OUT</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-storage!vMi89LFj_RRWhGmnjV24p2fL9UaN9iBNn4lRqyQllHA} per GB</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
                <div class="lb-txt-bold lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                 Provisioned Concurrency
                </div>
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p>Optionally, you can also enable Provisioned Concurrency for your serverless endpoints. Provisioned Concurrency allows you to deploy models on serverless endpoints with predictable performance, and high scalability by keeping your endpoints warm for specified number of concurrent requests and specified time. As with on-demand Serverless Inference, when Provisioned Concurrency is enabled, you pay for the compute capacity used to process inference requests, billed by the millisecond, and the amount of data processed. You also pay for Provisioned Concurrency usage, based on the memory configured, duration provisioned, and amount of concurrency enabled.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="aws-element-26225564-0b94-481e-abd5-c9ce9d03b7fa" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[_2D4CEXpGXco66hxw_eDuSYbt1NwGx8UOUz4YCrU8Q4 d]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[HQQV-0fyuRtpIDvLjjDoMicQrN5Z5UNIKEKNVutiTAU d]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[73E6W36qkX_zk7vDPYFMIIWyhmV7_56Culs5xHALafg d]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[O8zNojTp6rwznaBFlBRbT-r_0Cv1ZLKdCLnkg-_-iuk c]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[4D3fAI3rrw7Za17Elg-Rz3JRs25NHFO1cxjMVJ07PgE c]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[DVGlaMNfb5oiyKQRHNGV_zYAHWl84AzL0czHDLlOjBk c]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[4FOHxVlKdfGvy3uj3bSnAhflItRC95DdGZzaPTxJSV8 c]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[1Ygg0tM4R-x93JNMY8cEkTxv8TR7zE1WtaRzcGMbtAY d]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[B-WjPI92Yu1_I2igYQ0NdTD5yETuJYI-ZaOnmKdAx3g c]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[nqRlJ0k8kRDEJ1ek3TQfSVGBUIoXAbToWFh_2GL6BBk d]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[KLHaRfNaposdxPvY_dU2OvrgBlN1Pnyn2clhExCAwZA c]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-inference.[KGnys6uIDWMjn5qpWA5_LkRGB_Rc4qwyEmuWzx4oE00 d]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-26225564-0b94-481e-abd5-c9ce9d03b7fa-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<p>{regionSelector}</p>
