              <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
               <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                Ground Truth
               </div></li>
              <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-tab-21" id="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-panel-21" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
               <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                <h2 id="Object_pricing_details" class="lb-txt-bold lb-txt-none lb-h2 lb-title">Object pricing details</h2>
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p>You are charged for the number of dataset objects that are reviewed. A dataset object is defined as an atomic unit of data across all modalities. <br></p>
                </div>
                <h4 id="Reviewed_objects_.28images.2C_video_frames.2C_text_documents.2C_audio_files.2C_etc..29" class="lb-txt-bold lb-txt-none lb-h4 lb-title">Reviewed objects (images, video frames, text documents, audio files, etc.)</h4>
                <div id="aws-element-6a5363be-f4dd-496b-8b85-21dcf3f93f65" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[51RhgQ9Achc1o4QyZHo4XuMUdQ_mZ8G00Zg9hkOF9HQ]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[C_xJNEMkNm5SH9JbgpbCn6alVmodSPb6Xby2PAPkfMo]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[6sHz-UiyDDBXFiisIpJkZW29bthdrAjyIiJrBFjxWYs]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-6a5363be-f4dd-496b-8b85-21dcf3f93f65-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Number of reviewed objects per month</th><th>Price per reviewed object</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Less than 50,000 objects</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!6sHz-UiyDDBXFiisIpJkZW29bthdrAjyIiJrBFjxWYs}</td></tr>
<tr><td>50,000 to 1,000,000 objects</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!51RhgQ9Achc1o4QyZHo4XuMUdQ_mZ8G00Zg9hkOF9HQ}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Greater than 1,000,000 objects</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!C_xJNEMkNm5SH9JbgpbCn6alVmodSPb6Xby2PAPkfMo}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
                <h4 id="3D_point_clouds" class="lb-txt-none lb-h4 lb-title">3D point clouds</h4>
                <div id="aws-element-fcd0c89d-ef0b-45f7-b737-7a4c387e86e7" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[eXBgEsnVMslnNkNGFSFckIw5tJnZRIVPPqme8czBrCI]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[JmpFmNMuvtHy92mtRMNosJTEw-vDa3opZ99lP25yc9s]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-fcd0c89d-ef0b-45f7-b737-7a4c387e86e7-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Frame</th><th>Price per frame</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
