<tr><td>Sequence of frames</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!JmpFmNMuvtHy92mtRMNosJTEw-vDa3opZ99lP25yc9s} for 1st frame / {priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!eXBgEsnVMslnNkNGFSFckIw5tJnZRIVPPqme8czBrCI} for 2nd frame onwards</td></tr>
