                <h2 id="Labor_pricing_details" class="lb-txt-bold lb-txt-none lb-h2 lb-title">Labor pricing details</h2>
                <h4 id="Built-in_workflow_with_Amazon_Mechanical_Turk" class="lb-txt-none lb-txt-18 lb-h4 lb-title">Built-in workflow with Amazon Mechanical Turk</h4>
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p>If you use <a href="https://www.mturk.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon Mechanical Turk</a> for labeling, you are charged per object per review instance. We recommend that you use multiple labelers per object to improve label accuracy.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="aws-element-1ac9d847-51d1-44f2-80df-d1b163d28d0e" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[9RkUav2FY2QDQZbJhANXNY1kMx-ah-0g2DqNzGqBtoI]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[VkDt_RxL5LeUWY0eADFVmXZEQ69Hef8dDKKhJGKt8p8]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[iv5yfJIR4wnrrrmitl82Fkpg3mBc83QKFWfANwkvOes]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[mZ3Mizg67b64UJMojSb5UppJfywU6gTQb2Oq3uhLD6o]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/groundtruth.[EJ9f0oMfQsECYJ-4IQWC_McwFwyvGukwl7HyubcsbeA]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-1ac9d847-51d1-44f2-80df-d1b163d28d0e-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Workflow</th><th>Suggested price per labeler</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Image classification</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!iv5yfJIR4wnrrrmitl82Fkpg3mBc83QKFWfANwkvOes}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Text classification</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!EJ9f0oMfQsECYJ-4IQWC_McwFwyvGukwl7HyubcsbeA}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Named Entity Recognition (NER)</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!9RkUav2FY2QDQZbJhANXNY1kMx-ah-0g2DqNzGqBtoI}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bounding box</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/groundtruth!mZ3Mizg67b64UJMojSb5UppJfywU6gTQb2Oq3uhLD6o}</td></tr>
