</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
                <h4 id="Vendor" class="lb-txt-none lb-txt-18 lb-h4 lb-title">Vendor</h4>
                <div class="lb-rtxt">
                 <p>If you use a vendor, the cost per label is set by the vendor. You can see each vendor’s pricing details in <a href="/marketplace/b/6297422078" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AWS Marketplace</a>.&nbsp;</p>
                </div>
               </div></li>
              <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
               <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                Model Customization
               </div></li>
              <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-tab-22" id="aws-element-6640d79d-00fb-4403-a3c8-0f5746098d32-panel-22" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
               <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                <h2 id="Model_Customization" class="lb-txt-bold lb-txt-none lb-h2 lb-title">Model Customization</h2>
                <div id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e" class="lb-tabs lb-tabs-aui" data-is-rmc-enabled="false" data-lb-comp="tabs">
                 <ul role="tablist" aria-label="Tabs" class="lb-tabs-triggers lb-tabs-align-left">
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tab" aria-controls="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-1" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-1" class="lb-tabs-trigger lb-active" style="background-color:;">
                   <div>
                    <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                     Training
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tab" aria-controls="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-2" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-2" class="lb-tabs-trigger" style="background-color:;">
                   <div>
                    <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                     Evaluation
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tab" aria-controls="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-3" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-3" class="lb-tabs-trigger" style="background-color:;">
                   <div>
                    <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                     Data Generation
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tab" aria-controls="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-4" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-4" class="lb-tabs-trigger" style="background-color:;">
                   <div>
                    <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                     MultiTurn Reinforcement Learning - FineTuning
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tab" aria-controls="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-5" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-5" class="lb-tabs-trigger" style="background-color:;">
                   <div>
                    <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                     MultiTurn Reinforcement Learning - Evaluation
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                 </ul>
                 <ul class="lb-tabs-content">
                  <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger lb-active">
                   <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                    Training
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-1" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-1" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-active lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
                   <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                    <div id="apex-a204c131-4ba5-47ff-a651-39ad2b0afdd1" data-lb-comp="pricing-savings-plan:host-window-iframe" data-host="https://c0.b0.p.awsstatic.com">
                     <iframe sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups" class="m-pricing-savings-plan-iframe" frameborder="0" width="100%" data-src="https://c0.b0.p.awsstatic.com/#/apex/a204c131-4ba5-47ff-a651-39ad2b0afdd1" data-test="apex/a204c131-4ba5-47ff-a651-39ad2b0afdd1" loading="lazy"> </iframe>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lb-rtxt">
                     <p>With Amazon SageMaker AI, you can customize AI models through techniques such as supervised fine-tuning (SFT) and direct preference optimization (DPO). For both SFT and DPO customization, you are charged based on the total number of tokens processed during training. This is calculated by multiplying the number of tokens in your training dataset by the number of training epochs. For reinforcement learning (RL) customization, you are charged based on the duration of your training job. You are billed at an hourly rate that varies by model, with per-second billing for partial hours.&nbsp; Refer to the pricing table for prices for each model.</p>
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                  <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
                   <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                    Evaluation
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-2" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-2" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
                   <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                    <div id="apex-7dbf3d84-2ace-4b8a-af0a-1b98f1ffcfde" data-lb-comp="pricing-savings-plan:host-window-iframe" data-host="https://c0.b0.p.awsstatic.com">
                     <iframe sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups" class="m-pricing-savings-plan-iframe" frameborder="0" width="100%" data-src="https://c0.b0.p.awsstatic.com/#/apex/7dbf3d84-2ace-4b8a-af0a-1b98f1ffcfde" data-test="apex/7dbf3d84-2ace-4b8a-af0a-1b98f1ffcfde" loading="lazy"> </iframe>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lb-rtxt">
                     <p>With Amazon SageMaker AI, you can evaluate model performance using custom scorers and LLM-based evaluators. For both evaluation types, you are charged based on the number of input tokens being evaluated and the number of output tokens generated during evaluation. Pricing is calculated separately for input and output tokens, with rates that vary by model. When using LLM-based evaluators with Amazon Bedrock models as judges, you will be charged separately for the Bedrock model usage&nbsp;and the charges will appear under the Amazon Bedrock section in your AWS bill and are the same for all AWS Regions. Refer to the pricing table for specific input and output token prices for each model.</p>
                    </div>
                   </div></li>
                  <li class="lb-tabs-accordion-trigger">
                   <div class="lb-txt-none lb-txt">
                    Data Generation
                   </div></li>
                  <li tabindex="0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-tab-3" id="aws-element-61385bd4-22d4-48a3-994e-fa8b240d2d3e-panel-3" class="lb-tabs-content-item lb-comp-content-container lb-visibility-change">
                   <div class="lb-content-wrapper">
                    <div id="aws-element-73b747cb-5b2b-43b4-8f40-44dcee492f35" class="aws-plc aws-plc-richtext aws-table" data-token-paths="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization&quot;]" data-token-keys="[&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization.[71HjxqEpWV9APzSKUJnohVhBgzjAIGclJrfG4e-fGG8]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization.[NVLXIM4lJv4oMDA1J7b_vybyJAWex0SSoJiwZlMFjXA]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization.[F3Nnc6YCx-BWkHkaUy82ziq0us4Rjq-MhB40I_vqbj0]&quot;,&quot;sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization.[B_Qx4IVEGsHIorvk-giPMfEURQyXUPKi-yy-ShudwlE]&quot;]" data-token-bjs="false" data-no-region="[]" data-token-prefix="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-when-not-available="visible" data-template="#aws-element-73b747cb-5b2b-43b4-8f40-44dcee492f35-content" data-csml-endpoint="https://csml-plc-prod.us-west-2.api.aws/plc/csml/logging" data-pricing-markup="<p>{regionSelector}</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th><br></th><th>Price per million input tokens</th><th>Price per million output tokens</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Data generation job with contextual documents</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization!F3Nnc6YCx-BWkHkaUy82ziq0us4Rjq-MhB40I_vqbj0}</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization!B_Qx4IVEGsHIorvk-giPMfEURQyXUPKi-yy-ShudwlE}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Data generation job without contextual documents</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization!71HjxqEpWV9APzSKUJnohVhBgzjAIGclJrfG4e-fGG8}</td><td>{priceOf!sagemaker/sagemaker-model-customization!NVLXIM4lJv4oMDA1J7b_vybyJAWex0SSoJiwZlMFjXA}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
" data-pricing-endpoint="https://b0.p.awsstatic.com/pricing/2.0/meteredUnitMaps" data-partition="aws" data-locale="en-US" data-token-component-type="native-react"></div>
                    <div class="lb-rtxt">
                     <p>With Amazon SageMaker AI, you can generate synthetic datasets for AI model training and evaluation based on use case-specific annotation guidelines without configuring or managing any of the underlying infrastructure. You can provide samples and contextual documents to ground the data generation job. Pricing is calculated based on input tokens for samples and context documents and output tokens for the generated dataset.</p>
