              <div class="lb-rtxt">
               <p><b>Amazon SageMaker UltraServer details</b> <br></p>
              </div>
              <div class="lb-rtxt">
               <p>UltraServers offer a set of instances interconnected via a high bandwidth network domain. For example, the P6e-GB200 UltraServer connects up to 18 p6e-gb200.36xlarge instances under one NVIDIA NVLink domain. With 4 NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs per instance, each P6e-GB200 UltraServer therefore supports 72 GPUs, enabling you to run your largest AI workloads with high performance on SageMaker. <br></p>
